 "verdict": "positive",
 "finding": "Decoupling the adaptation LR flips the low-K FSMA deficit to POSITIVE on the adapted absolute AUC. At the budget-matched budget (x1) adapt_lr=3e-4 gives K5 +0.0117 (p=5.2e-4) and K10 +0.0075 (p=0.068). At a 4x budget the effect is larger because the coupled LR actively degrades low-K adaptation (K5 0.6077 -> 0.6431, +0.0355, p=1.3e-7; K10 0.6172 -> 0.6430, +0.0258, p=2.6e-4). K20 is positive but small/not significant. This is the resolution of \u7f3a\u53e3 C.",
